turned out that</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code><span class="p">(</span><span class="k">setq</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nv">lsp-java-java-path</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&quot;/usr/lib/jvm/java-21-openjdk/bin/java&quot;</span><span class="p">)</span>
